      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B003",
      "text": "When node or dirty information is present, version_from_scm appends a local version segment that includes the node hash and, when dirty=True, a dirty marker. The local segment is not required to use a g prefix or to omit .dirty."
